; `mirage configure` vendors an entire opam universe into mirage-smoke/duniverse/,
; including dune's own blackbox test suite, whose dune files are deliberately
; malformed. That directory is a build output of a different toolchain, not part of
; this project, so the host build must not descend into it.
;
; data_only_dirs rather than vendored_dirs: the files stay readable, which is what
; test/smoke/ needs in order to copy unikernel.ml and check it on the host.

(data_only_dirs mirage-smoke)
